<view class="page-body">
  <view class="card"><view class="inbox-title">收件箱 · {{pending}} 条待处理</view><view class="desc">集中处理跨端备份中的通知、课程建议与捕获内容。这里不会在后台执行桌面 AI 自动化规则。</view><view class="inbox-actions"><button class="btn pri small" bindtap="onCapture">捕获消息</button><button class="btn ghost small" bindtap="onCollectDue">整理今日/逾期待办</button></view><view class="search-wrap"><view class="search-ico"></view><input class="input" value="{{query}}" aria-label="搜索标题、内容或来源" bindinput="onSearch"/></view><view class="inbox-actions"><button class="btn small {{!showDone ? 'pri' : 'ghost'}}" data-done="false" bindtap="onFilter">待处理</button><button class="btn small {{showDone ? 'pri' : 'ghost'}}" data-done="true" bindtap="onFilter">已处理</button><text class="desc">共 {{total}} 条 · 第 {{pageNumber}} 页</text></view></view>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card inbox-item">
    <view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="desc">{{item.source}} {{item.when}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.attachments}}" class="desc">附 {{item.attachments}} 张图片，建任务时一起保留</view><view class="item-note">{{item.note}}</view>
    <view class="inbox-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.canCreate}}" class="btn pri small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCreateTask">建任务</button><button wx:if="{{item.taskId}}" class="btn ghost small" data-id="{{item.taskId}}" bindtap="onTask">查看任务</button><button wx:if="{{item.course}}" class="btn ghost small" bindtap="onCourse">打开课程表</button><button class="btn ghost small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCopy">复制完整内容</button><button class="btn ghost small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDone">{{item.done ? '恢复待处理' : '处理完成'}}</button></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">没有符合条件的事项。可从捕获页“存入收件箱”，或导入电脑端备份。</view>
  <view class="inbox-actions"><button wx:if="{{hasPrev}}" class="btn ghost" bindtap="onPrev">上一页</button><button wx:if="{{hasNext}}" class="btn pri" bindtap="onMore">下一页</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{undoMessage}}" class="mini-undo"><text>{{undoMessage}}</text><button class="btn ghost small" bindtap="onUndo">撤销</button></view>
</view>
